<title>USA: Pete's Brewing names Barnum president.</title>
<headline>Pete's Brewing names Barnum president.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pete's Brewing Co said Monday it had elected Scott Barnum president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Barnum was previously general manager of Miller Brewing Co subsidiary American Specialty &amp; Craft Beer Co. Miller is a unit of Philip Morris Cos Inc.</p>
<p>Jeff Atkins, Pete's chief executive officer, had been serving as acting COO since February.</p>
